    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-a0f83a69f6eb995ef0aca3aa",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "如卫星被控对象的奈奎斯特图所示，LQR 设计具有优异的稳定性品质，包括相位裕度 PM=65° 和无穷大增益裕度。然而，如果状态变量是通过估计而非直接测量得到的，这些品质可能无法实现。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "LQR designs have excellent stability properties, including a phase margin PM=65° and infinite gain margin, as shown in the Nyquist plot for the satellite plant. However, these properties may not be attainable if state variables are estimated rather than measured.",
